  "identifier": "orthanc",
  "name": "Orthanc",
  "description": "Lightweight, open-source RESTful DICOM server for medical imaging, widely used in hospitals, research institutions, and imaging workflows. Provides a web interface for uploading, receiving, and transferring DICOM images, a REST API for automating imaging workflows, and a plugin SDK for extending functionality. Plugins include PostgreSQL/MySQL storage backends, DICOMweb, and the Stone Web Viewer. Originated at the University Hospital of Liège; currently maintained by the Orthanc Team SRL with commercial support via Orthanc Services. GPL v3 (core), LGPL v3 (framework), 6,498 commits, v1.12.11, C++-based.",
  "url": "https://www.orthanc-server.com/",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/jodogne/OrthancMirror",
  "license": "GPL-3.0",
  "version": "1.12.11",
