  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference lightweight open-source DICOM server — widely embedded in hospital imaging workflows, research pipelines, and teleradiology platforms. GPL v3, 6,498 commits, v1.12.11, extensible plugin architecture. Originated at University Hospital of Liège; now maintained by Orthanc Team SRL with a commercial support tier. Complements dcm4che in the MACH catalog: Orthanc is the lightweight REST-first DICOM server; dcm4che is the comprehensive Java DICOM toolkit for enterprise PACS.",
